@startuml host_entrypoint
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Host mise entrypoint / shared-GPU host Docker execution
start
:Executor runs mise on the actual host;
:host:preflight records local mise/sbx identity and fixed help;
note right
  v2 reports file type/size before any content read.
  Hash regular files <=128 MiB; explicitly skip larger hashes.
  Preserve selected invocation paths for dispatching symlinks.
  This metadata does not register final artifact identity.
end note
:host:sbx-contract records six fixed subcommand help pages only;
:Retain received create/exec/stop/removal contract;
:Select host-backed state and shared-GPU host Docker target;
:host:admission-facts records self / selected-filesystem / GPU metadata;
if (Actual host facts and supported GPU runtime selected?) then (no)
  :Retain metadata and stop at tools/context boundary;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Freeze exact host seeding/provisioning plan and usable bytes;
endif
:Executor accepts complete Gate0 design and prerequisites;
:Obtain separate exact provisioning/capture/build grants;
:Host mise invokes selected supported provisioning operations;
:Register immutable outputs and admit job/outside controls;
:Qualify durable state and original-clock cleanup under fresh grants;
if (Gate0 + F9 + R4 + GPU + cross-cutting checks accepted?) then (no)
  :trainingReady=false; preserve all evidence; no retry/reset;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Technical readiness only; request separate training execution grant;
endif
:Host mise launches the admitted shared-GPU Docker learning job;
:Keep private state and failed evidence after owned job cleanup;
stop
@enduml
